# Compressed-size limit for each image variant, in decimal MB (1,000,000 bytes).
# .github/image-size.sh reads the lines below that are not comments.
noble 800
resolute 840

# How a limit is set: the larger of the variant's two compressed sizes, plus 10%,
# rounded up to the next 10 MB. A pull request raises a limit by editing this
# file and stating the reason beside the new figures. Before a publish, the only
# figures a pull request has are the noble amd64 and resolute amd64 sizes its own
# run printed.
